    {
      "PvfCommentType": "Section",
      "FileType": "nut",
      "Section": "clear_vector",
      "Title": "清空储存器内容",
      "Comment": "清空储存器内容\n需要配合 getVar() 使用\n例如：obj.getVar(\"fuck\").clear_vector();\n含义：清除名为\"fuck\"的储存器内的全部内容",
      "OfficialDescription": null,
      "Closing": false,
      "Authors": "糖糖QQ6494667"
    },
    {
      "PvfCommentType": "Section",
      "FileType": "nut",
      "Section": "dofile",
      "Title": "挂载外部文件",
      "Comment": "dofile 挂载并执行外部 .nut 脚本文件，语法：dofile(\"路径/文件名.nut\")",
      "OfficialDescription": null,
      "Closing": false,
      "Authors": "lostluna1"
    },
    {
      "PvfCommentType": "Section",
      "FileType": "nut",
      "Section": "else",
      "Title": "否则",
      "Comment": "否则分支语句，与 if 配对使用，当 if 条件不满足时执行 else 后的代码块",
      "OfficialDescription": null,
      "Closing": false,
      "Authors": "lostluna1"
    },
    {
      "PvfCommentType": "Section",
      "FileType": "nut",
      "Section": "for",
      "Title": "循环",
      "Comment": "for 循环语句，语法：for(local i = 0; i < n; i++) { ... }，用于按次数重复执行代码",
      "OfficialDescription": null,
      "Closing": false,
      "Authors": "lostluna1"
    },
    {
      "PvfCommentType": "Section",
      "FileType": "nut",
      "Section": "function",
      "Title": "声明一个函数/方法/功能等等",
      "Comment": "声明一个函数/方法/功能\n语法：function 函数名(参数1, 参数2, ...)\n{\n    具体实现代码;\n}",
      "OfficialDescription": null,
      "Closing": false,
      "Authors": "糖糖QQ6494667"
    },
    {
      "PvfCommentType": "Section",
      "FileType": "nut",
      "Section": "get_vector",
      "Title": "获取矢量存储器的存储内容",
      "Comment": "获取矢量存储器中指定位置的数据\n括号内为存储器的数据位置索引（从0开始）\n需要配合 obj.getVar() 使用\n例：obj.getVar(\"aaa\").get_vector(1);  // 获取存储器\"aaa\"的第1号数据",
      "OfficialDescription": null,
      "Closing": false,
      "Authors": "糖糖QQ6494667"
    },
    {
      "PvfCommentType": "Section",
      "FileType": "nut",
      "Section": "getCurrentSkillIndex",
      "Title": "获取释放的技能ID",
      "Comment": "获取当前释放的技能ID\n用法：obj.getCurrentSkillIndex()\n返回当前正在释放/使用的技能索引编号",
      "OfficialDescription": null,
      "Closing": false,
      "Authors": "糖糖QQ:6494667"
    },
    {
      "PvfCommentType": "Section",
      "FileType": "nut",
      "Section": "getVar",
      "Title": "获取矢量存储器",
      "Comment": "获取矢量存储器对象\n括号内为存储器名称ID（唯一、不可重复）\n用法：obj.getVar(\"存储器名称\")",
      "OfficialDescription": null,
      "Closing": false,
      "Authors": "糖糖QQ6494667"
    },
    {
      "PvfCommentType": "Section",
      "FileType": "nut",
      "Section": "pushState",
